{"text": "Here is the whole map. It starts with an evaluation and a strong context baseline; a fixed label goes to a small classifier. Every other gap takes one of four branches. Knowledge goes into the context. Behaviour goes to demonstrations or comparisons. Capability goes to a verifier or a teacher. Cost goes to distillation and deployment. Every path that changes weights then passes through the same three gates: where the data comes from, the constraints, and the evaluation.", "lang": "en", "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural", "duration": 32.388, "words": [[0.113, 0.237, "Here"], [0.562, 0.65, "is"], [0.65, 0.725, "the"], [0.738, 0.975, "whole"], [0.988, 1.375, "map"], [1.775, 1.837, "It"], [1.837, 2.163, "starts"], [2.163, 2.263, "with"], [2.263, 2.325, "an"], [2.325, 3.225, "evaluation"], [3.237, 3.362, "and"], [3.362, 3.412, "a"], [3.425, 4.087, "strong"], [4.1, 4.7, "context"], [4.713, 5.3, "baseline"], [5.812, 5.85, "a"], [5.85, 6.188, "fixed"], [6.2, 6.475, "label"], [6.487, 6.812, "goes"], [6.812, 6.925, "to"], [6.925, 7.0, "a"], [7.0, 7.412, "small"], [7.425, 8.213, "classifier"], [8.6, 8.85, "Every"], [8.863, 9.038, "other"], [9.05, 9.4, "gap"], [9.475, 9.737, "takes"], [9.738, 9.825, "one"], [9.825, 9.9, "of"], [9.9, 10.2, "four"], [10.2, 10.887, "branches"], [11.287, 11.688, "Knowledge"], [11.7, 12.025, "goes"], [12.037, 12.162, "into"], [12.162, 12.237, "the"], [12.25, 12.975, "context"], [13.387, 13.85, "Behaviour"], [13.85, 14.338, "goes"], [14.35, 14.475, "to"], [14.488, 15.525, "demonstrations"], [15.662, 15.838, "or"], [15.838, 16.65, "comparisons"], [17.062, 17.788, "Capability"], [18.038, 18.325, "goes"], [18.325, 18.462, "to"], [18.462, 18.525, "a"], [18.525, 19.287, "verifier"], [19.413, 19.525, "or"], [19.525, 19.562, "a"], [19.562, 20.125, "teacher"], [20.538, 20.888, "Cost"], [20.9, 21.15, "goes"], [21.163, 21.25, "to"], [21.25, 22.05, "distillation"], [22.062, 22.137, "and"], [22.137, 22.738, "deployment"], [23.113, 23.35, "Every"